    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/c2f733b5a276b431a7a862c352dede6e.avif?t=1753271280\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*This is a magical world. Come and start an interesting adventure!\u00a0(\u25cf\uff9f\u03c9\uff9f\u25cf)\u00a0 (\u25cf\uff9f\u03c9\uff9f\u25cf) \u00a0(\u25cf\uff9f\u03c9\uff9f\u25cf)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/d99af2a45b0903f92a97ca1fce90af6c.poster.avif?t=1753271280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/d99af2a45b0903f92a97ca1fce90af6c.webm?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/d99af2a45b0903f92a97ca1fce90af6c.mp4?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*You will play as a cute rabbit girl named Ruby and fight against another group of cute rabbit balls with their own characteristics.\u30fd(\uff65\u03c9\uff65\u00b4\uff92)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/aced527c6e0f8a9665a55f032704b609.poster.avif?t=1753271280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/aced527c6e0f8a9665a55f032704b609.webm?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/aced527c6e0f8a9665a55f032704b609.mp4?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*2.5D perspective map with rich interactive elements. You can destroy them crazily here.\u30fd(\uff40\u0414\u00b4)\uff89\u30fd(\uff40\u0414\u00b4)\uff89\u30fd(\uff40\u0414\u00b4)\uff89</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/09f8bd7f119b11770da4c3d65aae3ae6.poster.avif?t=1753271280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/09f8bd7f119b11770da4c3d65aae3ae6.webm?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/09f8bd7f119b11770da4c3d65aae3ae6.mp4?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014Game Features\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You will have a refreshing and smooth combat experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Destruction. Lots of destruction. You can be the bunny wrecker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> There are many levels, and each level has a different experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dynamic difficulty, you can upgrade and strengthen yourself, or make the enemy camp stronger, it all depends on you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiplayer, you can fight with your friends.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/c2f733b5a276b431a7a862c352dede6e.avif?t=1753271280\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*This is a magical world. Come and start an interesting adventure!\u00a0(\u25cf\uff9f\u03c9\uff9f\u25cf)\u00a0 (\u25cf\uff9f\u03c9\uff9f\u25cf) \u00a0(\u25cf\uff9f\u03c9\uff9f\u25cf)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/d99af2a45b0903f92a97ca1fce90af6c.poster.avif?t=1753271280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/d99af2a45b0903f92a97ca1fce90af6c.webm?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/d99af2a45b0903f92a97ca1fce90af6c.mp4?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*You will play as a cute rabbit girl named Ruby and fight against another group of cute rabbit balls with their own characteristics.\u30fd(\uff65\u03c9\uff65\u00b4\uff92)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/aced527c6e0f8a9665a55f032704b609.poster.avif?t=1753271280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/aced527c6e0f8a9665a55f032704b609.webm?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/aced527c6e0f8a9665a55f032704b609.mp4?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*2.5D perspective map with rich interactive elements. You can destroy them crazily here.\u30fd(\uff40\u0414\u00b4)\uff89\u30fd(\uff40\u0414\u00b4)\uff89\u30fd(\uff40\u0414\u00b4)\uff89</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/09f8bd7f119b11770da4c3d65aae3ae6.poster.avif?t=1753271280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/09f8bd7f119b11770da4c3d65aae3ae6.webm?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205570/extras/09f8bd7f119b11770da4c3d65aae3ae6.mp4?t=1753271280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014Game Features\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You will have a refreshing and smooth combat experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Destruction. Lots of destruction. You can be the bunny wrecker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> There are many levels, and each level has a different experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dynamic difficulty, you can upgrade and strengthen yourself, or make the enemy camp stronger, it all depends on you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiplayer, you can fight with your friends.</p></li></ul>",
